<http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/2008/11/OntologySecurity.owl> dc11:relation "This ontology covers the domain of security in the field of mobile applications.";
                                                                     a owl:Ontology.
ontosec:2.5G a owl:Class;
             rdfs:subClassOf ontosec:WANetwork.
